6-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 量化于自然数子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91804cbc70f118b6\" href=\"?note=91804cbc70f118b6\" title=\"43-df-minimal-pair\">43-df-minimal-pair</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T(A,B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T(A,B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>源书用无限损伤与长度一致性策略保证两个可枚举集不可计算、任何共同计算结果可计算。本项核对完整陈述与前提；没有把整个优先树构造缩写成未定义的局部公理。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 5.11.1 (Lachlan [166], Yates [323])，印刷页37，PDF页57。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-minimal-pair","status":"resolved","id":"91804cbc70f118b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-minimal-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"re